//! The SID decimator's anti-aliasing filter, written by
//! `examples/sid_fir_table.rs`: do not edit. 160 taps for each of 32 + 1
//! fractional positions at the intermediate rate; Kaiser window for
//! 80 dB; pass band to 20000 Hz and stop band from 28000 Hz at
//! 246312 Hz; each row sums to 131072, unity in Q17.
//!
//! Source: own design; the Kaiser window formulas are Kaiser's (1974), as
//! in Oppenheim and Schafer, "Discrete-Time Signal Processing", section 7.5.

